  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I was just working through the cube tutorial and I got stuck on the VRChat Udon - Program Variables.\nI spend almost 60 minutes debugging until I saw the comment under the youtube video saying that you need to declare a variable speedProgram for the value saved with \"Udon Behaviour set program variable\"\nWhich he did not do in the tutorial, so if you follow the tutorial it does not work.\nI at least got to play around with debug.log and such but that was a very annoying error to encounter 30 minutes into getting started with udon",
